DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Interval");

$set_ans_4 = Compute("[1, 11] U ([1, 11] U ([1, 11] U ([1, 11]))) U ({4, 5, 13, 14, 17} U {4, 5, 13, 14, 17}) U ({4, 5, 13, 14, 17})");
$set_ans_5 = Compute("{4, 8} U {4, 5, 13, 14, 17}");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("{1, 7, 19} U {1, 7, 19} U {1, 7, 19}");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("{1, 7, 19} U ({1, 7, 19})");
$set_ans_3 = Compute("{1, 7, 19} U {1, 7, 19}");

Context("Vector");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle 5, 3, 20 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 3, 10, 12 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{w} = \langle 8, 1, 7 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{w} \times \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<8, 1, 7>") x Compute("<3, 10, 12>")}
- [` \left\| \vec{v} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<3, 10, 12>"))}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<3, 10, 12>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<5, 3, 20>"))}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle 2, 14, 19 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 9, 1, 5 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{w} = \langle 20, 4, 13 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{w} \cdot \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<20, 4, 13>") . Compute("<2, 14, 19>")}
- [` \vec{v} \cdot \vec{w} = `] [_____]{Compute("<9, 1, 5>") . Compute("<20, 4, 13>")}
- [` \vec{v} \times \vec{w} = `] [_____]{Compute("<9, 1, 5>") x Compute("<20, 4, 13>")}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<9, 1, 5>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- [` \vec{v} \times \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<9, 1, 5>") x Compute("<2, 14, 19>")}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{1, 13, 16\}`]
- [`B = \{1, 7, 19\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`B \cup (B) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}
- [`B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{4, 5, 13, 14, 17\}`]
- [`B = \{4, 8\}`]
- [`C = \{x | 1 \leq x \leq 11\}`]

Compute:
- [`C \cup (C \cup (C \cup (C))) \cup (A \cup A) \cup (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}

---

[`12+7-19+19*10`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(190.),width=>6}
---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
